      "description": {
        "en-US": "Allows QR-code binding from mobile QQ, message template preview, test pushes, and delivery status in the admin panel.",
        "zh-CN": "允许在后台完成手机 QQ 扫码绑定、预览消息模板、发送测试消息与查看推送状态。"
